st failure mode in safety-critical rail inspection. Target recall >0.85. Binary classification with low threshold maximizes recall vs multi-class which risks confusion between defect subtypes."}, {"id": "concept_yolov8n_pretrained", "label": "YOLOv8n Pretrained Base Model", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "POC/APPROACH.md", "source_location": "What is yolov8n.pt?", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "concept_best_pt", "label": "best.pt Trained Model Checkpoint", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "POC/APPROACH.md", "source_location": "What is best.pt?", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}], "edges": [{"source": "approach_binary_defect_detection", "target": "approach_class_naming_conflict", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "POC/APPROACH.md", "source_location": "Approach 4 - Why this is the best approach", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "approach_recall_priority", "target": "approach_binary_defect_detection", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "POC/APPROACH.md", "source_location": "Phase 5 - Evaluate section", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "approach_merge_datasets_script", "target": "yaml_data_combined", "relation": "references", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.85, "source_file": "POC/APPROACH.md", "source_location": "Phase 2 section", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "approach_merge_datasets_script", "target": "approach_binary_defect_detection", "relation": "implements", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "POC/APPROACH.md", "source_location": "Phase 2 section", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "approach_transfer_learning", "target": "concept_yolov8n_pretrained", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "POC/APPROACH.md", "source_location": "Phase 4 section", "we